WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.033 --> 00:00:01.868
-Welcome, welcome, welcome to

00:00:01.868 --> 00:00:02.834
"The Tonight Show," everybody.

00:00:02.834 --> 00:00:04.267
You're here. You're watching.

00:00:04.267 --> 00:00:05.133
Thank you for watching.

00:00:05.133 --> 00:00:07.167
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:07.167 --> 00:00:08.434
Let's get to some news.

00:00:08.434 --> 00:00:10.367
Well, guys, today
President Biden announced

00:00:10.367 --> 00:00:12.567
that the U.S. is banning imports

00:00:12.567 --> 00:00:16.167
of Russian vodka, diamonds,
and seafood.

00:00:16.167 --> 00:00:17.367
Yeah.
In related news,

00:00:17.367 --> 00:00:18.701
the next season
of "The Bachelor"

00:00:18.701 --> 00:00:20.067
is delayed until further notice.

00:00:20.067 --> 00:00:23.067
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:23.067 --> 00:00:24.767
But don't worry, there's still
a guy in Times Square

00:00:24.767 --> 00:00:26.400
selling all that stuff
on a blanket.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:27.934
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:27.934 --> 00:00:29.767
"That looks good."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.767 --> 00:00:31.667
Meanwhile, the White House
just held a Zoom call

00:00:31.667 --> 00:00:33.901
with 30 of the biggest
TikTok stars

00:00:33.901 --> 00:00:36.100
to brief them
on the war in Ukraine.

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:37.667
[ Laughter ]
Then, later in the day,

00:00:37.667 --> 00:00:40.000
Biden discussed mind-blowing
life hacks with the Pentagon.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.901
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.901 --> 00:00:43.801
The meeting ended
after the TikTok stars

00:00:43.801 --> 00:00:45.634
talked Biden
into inhaling tanning spray.

00:00:45.634 --> 00:00:46.901
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.901 --> 00:00:48.033
Jeesh!

00:00:48.033 --> 00:00:52.067
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.067 --> 00:00:54.267
Speaking --

00:00:54.267 --> 00:00:56.234
Speaking of TikTok,
I read that sales

00:00:56.234 --> 00:00:58.534
at Barnes &amp; Noble
are skyrocketing

00:00:58.534 --> 00:01:00.467
because so many
TikTokers have been posting

00:01:00.467 --> 00:01:02.334
about buying books at the store.

00:01:02.334 --> 00:01:03.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.467 --> 00:01:04.701
Right now, RadioShack is like,

00:01:04.701 --> 00:01:05.767
"For the love of God, do that

00:01:05.767 --> 00:01:07.868
with old electronics,
old electronics!

00:01:07.868 --> 00:01:10.267
Get into old --
Batteries, something!"

00:01:10.267 --> 00:01:11.634
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.634 --> 00:01:13.033
That's right,
Barnes &amp; Noble is like,

00:01:13.033 --> 00:01:15.234
"Oh, man, we're this close
to no longer being considered

00:01:15.234 --> 00:01:16.367
a public restroom.

00:01:16.367 --> 00:01:18.067
We're this close.
Almost there."

00:01:18.067 --> 00:01:19.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:19.467 --> 00:01:21.133
But this is exciting --
this weekend is

00:01:21.133 --> 00:01:24.100
Selection Sunday,
which means March Madness is

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:26.033
almost here, yeah!

00:01:26.033 --> 00:01:29.334
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:01:29.334 --> 00:01:30.868
That's right,
it's that time of year

00:01:30.868 --> 00:01:32.767
when people spend hours
on their brackets

00:01:32.767 --> 00:01:34.534
and then do their taxes
in five minutes.

00:01:34.534 --> 00:01:36.567
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.567 --> 00:01:39.734
Meanwhile, this Sunday is also
Daylight Savings Time.

00:01:39.734 --> 00:01:41.300
[ Cheering ]
Yep, that's right,

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:42.400
we'll lose an hour.

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:43.901
And if you watched
"The Masked Singer"

00:01:43.901 --> 00:01:45.267
on Wednesday,
that means you lost two hours.

00:01:45.267 --> 00:01:48.267
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:50.667 --> 00:01:52.501
Get this --
according to a new survey,

00:01:52.501 --> 00:01:54.234
Americans who live
in the Northeast

00:01:54.234 --> 00:01:56.701
are the worst snorers
in the country.

00:01:56.701 --> 00:01:58.534
[ Laughter ]
Which I guess explains

00:01:58.534 --> 00:02:01.234
the new Mucinex commercial
airing in Boston. Watch this.

00:02:01.234 --> 00:02:02.934
-I bet you snore like an [bleep]

00:02:02.934 --> 00:02:04.167
-Yeah, thanks to you.

00:02:04.167 --> 00:02:05.567
I got loogies at nighttime

00:02:05.567 --> 00:02:07.133
and it's hardcore
wicked unpleasant.

00:02:07.133 --> 00:02:08.434
[ Laughter ]
-You blow chunks outta tea?

00:02:08.434 --> 00:02:10.300
-I sers wheeze
when I'm at Dunky's.

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:12.100
-You sound like a chowderhead.

00:02:12.100 --> 00:02:14.400
-I'm not going to argue
with a frickin' sack of puke.

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:16.300
-Watch this Green Monster
bang a U-ey.

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:17.734
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:17.734 --> 00:02:20.567
Can we get Plymouth Rock
out of the frickin' aisle?

00:02:20.567 --> 00:02:21.634
-He's a townie.

00:02:21.634 --> 00:02:23.434
-If you snore
like a little bitch,

00:02:23.434 --> 00:02:26.501
get Mucinex Fast Night Time,
you frickin' jerk.

00:02:26.501 --> 00:02:27.901
Go, Sox!

00:02:27.901 --> 00:02:29.701
-Unbelievable.
They're airing that.

00:02:29.701 --> 00:02:30.534
[ Cheering and applause ]
-Wow!

00:02:30.534 --> 00:02:31.901
-They're airing it in Boston.

00:02:31.901 --> 00:02:33.934
I saw that.

00:02:33.934 --> 00:02:35.601
-In Boston.
Airs in Boston.

00:02:35.601 --> 00:02:37.634
-I have a Boston feed
in my office.

00:02:37.634 --> 00:02:38.801
[ Voices overlapping ]
Exactly.

00:02:38.801 --> 00:02:40.501
[ Laughter ]
Oh, I saw, guys,

00:02:40.501 --> 00:02:43.200
for the first time ever,
the Tin Man's oil can

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:45.501
from "The Wizard of Oz"
is going up for auction.

00:02:45.501 --> 00:02:48.801
[ Audience oohs ]
The bidding starts at $200,000.

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:50.968
But only because it has
a little oil left in it.

00:02:50.968 --> 00:02:54.767
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:54.767 --> 00:02:56.267
And, finally,
the U.S. Border agents

00:02:56.267 --> 00:02:57.734
arrested a man in California

00:02:57.734 --> 00:03:01.868
after they found 52 reptiles
hidden under his clothes.

00:03:01.868 --> 00:03:03.167
[ Ews and ohs ]

00:03:03.167 --> 00:03:04.534
Authorities were suspicious when

00:03:04.534 --> 00:03:06.367
a tongue shot out of his fly
and ate a mouse.

00:03:06.367 --> 00:03:07.300
[ Laughter and applause ]
We have a great show.

